file tools/hooks/post-commit new -- reads the commits pre-commit never sees, by asking whether its sibling ran rather than by probing four sequencer paths
file tools/hooks/pre-commit rule one gains the debt marker as a second trigger, and drops the token on its success path only
file tools/fixtures/g/generated_page_freshness_control.sh six sequencer cases, the refusal proven to keep the debt, and the planted seed's own --no-verify debt cleared with a reason
file tools/g/generated_page_freshness_witness.rish the six new assertions, the post-commit mode checked as hard as the wall's, and the five-path table written where it binds
file tools/i/install_hooks.rish asserts the new hook present and executable before arming, since a hook at 100644 is one git skips without a word
